 1-0  Running EAE
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

 E.A.E. (External Account Editor) for Tempest BBS!

 Programmed by: Michael Bockert

  Syntax: EAE (Optional Flags)
 Example: EAE -s115

 (Optional Flags)

  -s (UserSlot) Slot Number of user to auto edit.
  -p (Preset)   Preset to set user to automaticly.
  -m (Mode)     Run Iconify Mode. (0=Expand, 1=Iconify)
  -l (LeftEdge) Left Edge of Iconify Window to open.
  -t (TopEdge)  Top  Edge of Iconify Window to open.
  -w (Width)    Width of Iconify window to open.

