 4.0  Global Account Editors
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

 Global Account Edit Menu:
 ========================
 (1) Globally toggle an Area On/Off.
 (2) Globally toggle User Optional Flags On/Off.
 (3) Globally set users to a preset.


    4.1  Globally toggle an Area On/Off
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Allows you to turn a single area on or off for all users.

    - Can define low and high access level range of users to be edited.
    - Can define Different types of Access to an area such as
      (Msg Area Only, File Area Only, Both)



    4.2  Globally toggle User Optional Flags On/Off
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Allows you to turn a multiple/single Optional Flags On or Off.

    - Can define low and high access level range of users to be edited.
    - Can start out using one of the preset's optional flags.



    4.3  Globally set users to a Preset
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Allows you to set all user accounts access to a preset.

    - Can define low and high access level range of users to be edited.
    - Can Edit any number of the following sections of the preset:

      Change the Security Level.[Y/n]:
      Change the File Ratio.....[Y/n]:
      Change the Byte Ratio.....[Y/n]:
      Change the Time Allowed...[Y/n]:
      Change the Daily Messages.[Y/n]:
      Change the DL/UL Limits...[Y/n]:
      Change the OPTION FLAGS...[Y/n]:
      Change the FILE FLAGS.....[Y/n]:
      Change the MESSAGE FLAGS..[Y/n]:

